---@field PrepareStatus? aws.datasync.PhaseStatus The status of the PREPARING step for your task execution. For more information, see Task execution statuses.
---@field TotalDuration? aws.datasync.Duration The time in milliseconds that your task execution ran.
---@field TransferDuration? aws.datasync.Duration The time in milliseconds that your task execution was in the TRANSFERRING step. For more information, see Task execution statuses.
