---@field VerifyDuration? aws.datasync.Duration The time in milliseconds that your task execution was in the VERIFYING step. For more information, see Task execution statuses.
---@field VerifyStatus? aws.datasync.PhaseStatus The status of the VERIFYING step for your task execution. For more information, see Task execution statuses.
---@field ErrorCode? aws.datasync.string An error that DataSync encountered during your task execution. You can use this information to help troubleshoot issues.
---@field ErrorDetail? aws.datasync.string The detailed description of an error that DataSync encountered during your task execution. You can use this information to help troubleshoot issues.

