---@field Schedule? aws.datasync.TaskSchedule Specifies a schedule for when you want your task to run. For more information, see Scheduling your task.
---@field Name? aws.datasync.TagValue Specifies the name of your task.
---@field CloudWatchLogGroupArn? aws.datasync.LogGroupArn Specifies the Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of an Amazon CloudWatch log group for monitoring your task.
---@field Includes? aws.datasync.FilterList Specifies include filters define the files, objects, and folders in your source location that you want DataSync to transfer. For more information and examples, see Specifying what DataSync transfers by using filters.
---@field ManifestConfig? aws.datasync.ManifestConfig Configures a manifest, which is a list of files or objects that you want DataSync to transfer. For more information and configuration examples, see Specifying what DataSync transfers by using a manifest.
---@field TaskReportConfig? aws.datasync.TaskReportConfig Specifies how you want to configure a task report, which provides detailed information about your DataSync transfer. For more information, see Monitoring your DataSync transfers with task reports.

